!results/optimization_2026-08-20/goal_line_quad_045_A_to_B_run_03/
!results/optimization_2026-08-20/goal_line_quad_045_A_to_B_run_03/**
# Keep the 2026-08-21 optimization exploration and formal v2 regression
# reviewable. Exploratory runs remain labelled as such in the report.
!results/optimization_2026-08-21/
!results/optimization_2026-08-21/**

